{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And it shall be for you for a sign upon your hand.</b> All this you shall say to your son. 'And it shall be for you for a sign, etc.' — one section consisting of four passages." "<b>For you for a sign.</b> The verse gives <b>for you for a sign</b> first and afterward for others — that is <b>and for a remembrance between your eyes</b>. And this is what is stated: 'and all the peoples of the earth shall see that the name of HaShem is called upon you,' and the Master said: these are the head-tefillin."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:57:34.102949694Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}